Subject: [PATCH v2 04/18] sunrpc: Move trace_svc_xprt_dequeue()
From: Chuck Lever <chuck.lever@oracle.com>
To: bfields@fieldses.org
Cc: linux-nfs@vger.kernel.org
Date: Tue, 27 Mar 2018 10:50:07 -0400
Message-ID: <20180327145007.7710.46380.stgit@oracle-ib-101.nfsv4bat.org>
In-Reply-To: <20180327144420.7710.82288.stgit@oracle-ib-101.nfsv4bat.org>
References: <20180327144420.7710.82288.stgit@oracle-ib-101.nfsv4bat.org>
